            <ArticleTitle>Brainstem discharge sites: therapeutic targets for chronic pain.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>432-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Optimum mesothalamic targets for therapeutic electrode implants are characterized by (1) spontaneously occurring focal discharges, (2) attenuation of the discharges by electrical stimulation, and (3) stimulation-induced pain relief.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
